=== an input that fails when resumed says so, tagged with its number
let r = new PromiseBuilder<Int>();
let g2 = (await r.promise) / 0
r.complete(1);
g2
let s = new PromiseBuilder<Int>();
let g3 = (await s.promise) + 1
s.complete(2);
g3
--- transcript
interactive#0: void
1 promise is unresolved.
interactive#1: fail
interactive#1 failed
interactive#2: void
Failed: g2 has no value: interactive#1 failed
interactive#3: fail
interactive#4: void
1 promise is unresolved.
interactive#5: fail
interactive#6: void
interactive#7: 3
